flowchart LR
  Browser[Browser / Playwright] --> Auth[Auth + workspace ativo]
  Auth --> API[TanStack Start API routes]
  API --> DB[(Supabase)]
  API --> Evo[Evolution API]
  Evo --> Webhook[/api/public/webhooks/evolution]
  Webhook --> Queue[Event inbox / worker]
  Queue --> DB
  DB --> Events[/api/events + Realtime]
  Events --> Browser

